      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, because if a crasher is causing several people to disappear, it would be hard to identify who that specific person if everyone is crashing. You can't even report if you can't even see who they could be. If world logs can be captured for if several people crash at once and not via portal or world switch, flagging the remaining people to identify potential crashers would be a great tool for admins to catch people violating ToS.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
