      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also log of information with the (in game) time where they entered/left as well as ping, and frame rates , as well as a log that keeps and list of names for people that are still in it up to 3 worlds besides there will be no back fire because how are the said crashers going to know that you're going to report or just going back to see a friend or to see if they left sometimes they're talking trash and playing meme music saying that I'm a persistent questie , but I can't report them because they hit me before I click on them, they also tend to have very complex names a list containing this information could possibly help me out on striking them back with justice, because I even get a full glimpse of their name status , etc before I get hit with the 2nd wave of crashing imagine the hypocritical mindset of reporting (or filing false reports) while being a crasher and if they did file a false report there should be a way for a person to prove they're innocent by giving them strikes and if they're not malicious users over a period of time then I should reset if they get reported repeatedly and by enough people there should be a ban , avatar crashes can sometimes be accidental due to a nooby or a child who thinks flashy and big avatars are cool but those guys who called me persistent and talking trash when I join the 2nd time deserve no mercy Im also about to start video recording when I rejoin because I had my safety settings to the max and they still somehow manage to get me",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
