  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-10T14:12:03.013Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whenever someone crashes a whole lobby they usually don't crash with them. Flagging an account with this behavior overtime (everyone suddenly leaving, they + some other people staying) would narrow down the number of possible crashers and would, in my opinion, be a system more reliable in discovering them than the current report system.",
